    LLM: "Hoard Aces and 7s. Lead low worthless cards to bait opponents into playing Aces.\n\nTrump Management: Don't waste Aces or 7s trumping low cards. Save trumps to beat opponent's Aces of side suits.\n\nStock Counting: As the deck depletes, track what's left. If you know the Ace of Hearts is unplayed, lead a heart to pull it out.",
